# 【告警變成信】送一個測試告警,收件匣收到一封:主旨、收件人、內文正確
$ POST /api/v2/alerts(Alertmanager);GET /api/v1/messages(郵件伺服器)
▶ 送一個 warning 測試告警給 Alertmanager;依設定等 group_wait(10 秒)後寄出,收件匣應該收到一封
送出測試告警:[HTTP 200]
   14 秒後:收到主旨含 MailTest 的信
收件匣:
  [Kafka][FIRING] MailTest(warning) | kafka-ops@corp.demo | 1 alert for alertname=MailTest severity=warning View in Alertmanager [1] Firing 
  [Kafka][FIRING] KafkaConsumerLagHigh(warning) | kafka-ops@corp.demo | 1 alert for alertname=KafkaConsumerLagHigh severity=warning View in Alertmanager
判定:告警變成信:主旨「[Kafka][FIRING] MailTest(warning)」,寄給維運群組信箱 kafka-ops@corp.demo
